# Reduced failures of the chunk index's metamorphic test (meta_test.go), each the ops of one seed
# under the option set that failed, its cadence written as explicit ops. Ops: write and punch
# chunk version first count lba; freeze chunk version epoch lba; move chunk block from to header;
# release chunk version; lookup chunk block count; at chunk block count epoch; chunk c; frozenat
# chunk epoch; live header; check. A block reads as version:lba:header, or miss. go test -rewrite
# regenerates the output.

# A chunk first written after a cut reads absent at the snapshot, before and after a restart that
# replays its absent freeze, and a cleaner move after the restart changes only the live map.
run set=A
freeze 0 0 1 100
write 0 1 0 2 101
at 0 0 2 1
flush
write 0 2 1 1 104
restart
at 0 0 2 1
lookup 0 0 2
chunk 0
frozenat 0 1
move 0 0 102 107 106
lookup 0 0 2
live 101
live 106
check
----
at 0 0 2 1: miss miss
at 0 0 2 1: miss miss
lookup 0 0 2: 1:102:101 2:105:104
chunk 0: 2:1
frozenat 0 1: 0
move 0 0 102 107 106: moved 1
lookup 0 0 2: 1:107:106 2:105:104
live 101: 0
live 106: 1
